 * of todos (written by the `max` id strategy) and `{ lastId, todos }` (written
 * by `sequence`). Unknown fields on a todo are kept, not stripped.
 * @param {unknown} document
 * @param {string} filePath Used in error messages.
 * @returns {import('./todos.js').TodoState}
 * @throws {TodoError} CORRUPT_FILE describing the first problem found.
